graph TD
    req[New logical token] --> lookup[Block-table lookup]
    lookup --> alloc_p{Logical block<br/>already mapped?}
    alloc_p -->|No| alloc_new[Take a free block,<br/>add block-table entry]
    alloc_new --> write[Write K,V into<br/>the mapped slot]
    alloc_p -->|Yes| write
    write -. shared prefix .-> share[Two sequences can<br/>share prefix blocks]
